hq8BHShcAhsQ3IcHCGUoEQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["煽系拉麵是先以大火爆炒配料，再加入高湯熬煮，湯頭層次分明，帶有濃厚的鑊氣。我個人覺得不同口味的湯頭彼此差異不大，主要是因為炒料的風味相當強烈；叉燒很不錯，連我這平常不吃豬肉的人都覺得好吃；麵條微捲，剛上桌時口感偏硬。\n\n缺點是店內通風不佳，油煙味偏重；另外等候時間也很長，如果不是第一輪入座，通常都需要等至少40分鐘以上。\n\n🔅塩味拉麵 $250👍🏻👍🏻\n塩味不是一般常見的清湯型，而是多種食材大火爆炒後的精華，風味層次分明，口感溫和不死鹹。\n\n🔅醬油拉麵 $250\n醬油的風味並不明顯，都被爆炒過後帶有鑊氣的湯頭蓋過去了，整體風味與塩味差異不大。\n\n🔅魚介味噌拉麵 $280👍🏻👍🏻\n魚介風味淡雅，味噌也不會過重或太死鹹，兩者比例拿捏得很好，整個湯頭很有層次，把湯全部喝光也都不會覺得膩。加入唐辛子後，湯頭會帶點微辣，是一個不錯的風味轉換。\n\nℹ️臨時店休會公告在Facebook。\nℹ️內用僅7個座位，客滿時採登記候位，若超過三組沒到齊會被取消。\nℹ️現金付款。",null,[0,108]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVFUxWFVrZE9SMk4zVTI1YVJsUkVUakpTVmxJeFpIcFdjbGR1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVFUxWFVrZE9SMk4zVTI1YVJsUkVUakpTVmxJeFpIcFdjbGR1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVFUxWFVrZE9SMk4zVTI1YVJsUkVUakpTVmxJeFpIcFdjbGR1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVFUxWFVrZE9SMk4zVTI1YVJsUkVUakpTVmxJeFpIcFdjbGR1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVFUxWFVrZE9SMk4zVTI1YVJsUkVUakpTVmxJeFpIcFdjbGR1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwVFUxWFVrZE9SMk4zVTI1YVJsUkVUakpTVmxJeFpIcFdjbGR1WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,4930,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0TU1XUkdOR2N3U25aRlRETjJSVlIxZHpWclduYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa07f719df2f937b9!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOktMMWRGNGcwSnZFTDN2RVR1dzVrWnc%7C%7C?