-Hant"],[["「北一家拉麵」，一進門就能感受到濃厚的老派日本職人氛圍。老闆與老闆娘非常客氣且親切，那種默默耕耘、充滿人情味的互動，真的會讓人彷彿一秒置身日本當地的社區小店。這裡主打正宗的札幌味噌與鹽味拉麵，湯頭醇厚濃郁卻不會過於死鹹，麵條 Q 彈且完美吸附湯汁，叉燒更是厚實入味，口味上絕對是實力派的好吃。\n\n不過，正因為味道道地，加上店內空間小、座位非常有限，排隊基本上是日常便飯。用餐尖峰時段在外面等上半小時到一小時都很正常，且店內因為空間較緊湊，吃飽後比較不適合久坐聊天。但看在能吃到一碗由日本老闆親手現做、充滿誠意的拉麵份上，這點等待的時間成本完全值得，是內湖非常推薦的寶藏拉麵店。",null,[0,146]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvWmxkVlRscFdiVFZQVVc1V2VWUllhRmhoYTFwUFYxWkdSbEV6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvWmxkVlRscFdiVFZQVVc1V2VWUllhRmhoYTFwUFYxWkdSbEV6WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvWmxkVlRscFdiVFZQVVc1V2VWUllhRmhoYTFwUFYxWkdSbEV6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvWmxkVlRscFdiVFZQVVc1V2VWUllhRmhoYTFwUFYxWkdSbEV6WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvWmxkVlRscFdiVFZQVVc1V2VWUllhRmhoYTFwUFYxWkdSbEV6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10584014678872789672/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvWmxkVlRscFdiVFZQVVc1V2VWUllhRmhoYTFwUFYxWkdSbEV6WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,4386,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oZldVTlpWbTVPUW5WeVRYaFhha1pPV1ZGRlEzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa07f719df2f937b9!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmhfWUNZVm5OQnVyTXhXakZOWVFFQ3c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oZldVTlpWbTVPUW5WeVRYaFhha1pPV1ZGRlEzYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oZldVTlpWbTVPUW5WeVRYaFhha1pPV1ZGRlEzYxI-Ci9DQUlRQ